 "uid": "dexarb-go-services",
 "description": "Go runtime + HTTP RED for the Go services. Filtered on the Prometheus `job` label: go_*/process_* series have no `service` label, and the HTTP const label differs from the job for mm-controller (`mmcontroller`). WebSocket routes are excluded from latency — their duration is the connection lifetime.",
